      "message": "If we care about keeping the Validator optimal, we could avoid the extra cost of `std::function` storage by inlining these in the header file, and using an \u0027auto\u0027 return type to have them return the lambda object directly. This, combined with the r-value forwarded Check functions above, would result in the compiler being able to inline the calls directly, rather than doing an indirect call via the function pointer.",
